  "reviewNotes": [
    "The current 2025 Russian spleen-trauma recommendation confirms PTS use and defines severe trauma as score <=8.",
    "The six-component scoring matrix is linked to the classic PTS definition; current Russian KR relevance and classic matrix provenance are kept separate.",
    "Historical mortality percentages sometimes reproduced with PTS are intentionally omitted because they are not needed for the current Russian source contract.",
    "Subjective categories such as airway and open-wound severity require clinical judgment; MiniMed must not imply measurement precision that the score does not have.",
    "Promotion to runtime requires rights review and clinician review of terminology."
